{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09678","headline":"胡笳歌送颜真卿使赴河陇 · 岑参","name":"胡笳歌送颜真卿使赴河陇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不闻胡笳声最悲，紫髯绿眼胡人吹。\n吹之一曲犹未了，愁杀楼兰征戍儿。\n凉秋八月萧关道，北风吹断天山草。\n崑仑山南月欲斜，胡人向月吹胡笳。\n胡笳怨兮将送君，秦山遥望陇山云。\n边城夜夜多愁梦，向月胡笳谁喜闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}